/ActualText (Product Designer with 10+ years designing B2B platforms, enterprise SaaS and hardware-connected \(IoT\) products: real-time tracking dashboards, device companion apps, multi-country e-commerce and virtual event platforms. Owns the full product lifecycle \204 discovery and user research, user flows, wireframes, interactive prototypes, design systems and developer handoff. Works closely with product managers, developers and hardware/firmware engineers, and uses AI tools \(Claude, Cursor\) to speed up prototyping and documentation.)
